==Battleground==
*1 [[The 10th Angel (Enemy)|The 10th Angel]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] and other [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]]. Timing is of the utmost importance to stall Zeruel. Add quick cats such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev]] to deliver more damage. It will take a while to finish this stage though. Bring Sniper the Cat to keep him away from your Cat Base.

If you don't have A.Bahamut, try to stall it by using [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]], [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|its Crazed counterpart]], [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Cutter]] (can boost a little bit because of its strengthen), [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Hyper Mr.]] works too and your timing also needs to be accurate.

If you have both [[Kaworu & Cat (Special Cat)|Kaworu & Cat]] and [[Shinji & Cat (Rare Cat)|Shinji & Cat]] this stage is a cakewalk. Activate [[You Will Find Happiness (Combo)|their combo]] and spam them, maybe spawning some fast units to help stall. This stage is even easier if you have a powerful unit with EVA Angel Killer.

[[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Macho Cat]] also makes this stage much easier due to being able to survive multiple attacks from Zeruel.

